    "norm": "A thread that attempts a single non-blocking {@code tryAcquire()} on a {@link TimedSemaphore} and records whether the attempt succeeded. <p>All threads wait on a shared {@code startSignal} latch before calling {@code tryAcquire()}, so they all compete simultaneously within the same time period.</p>"
